    "job": "Fold-up tray",
    "revision": "A",
    "notes": "Two jobs, two layers, two powers: Score marks the fold lines at 22% without severing them, Cut takes the outline out at 95%. Score runs first — once the outline is cut the net is loose on the bed, and scoring a part that has shifted is scrap."
  },
